            if (ds.cohesion < 45) ds.fractured = true;

            // Expansion ROI: realised APAC revenue is driven by the INTERACTION of diversity
            // (local market knowledge), cohesion (ability to execute) and entry readiness
            // (sequencing + integration). A high index with collapsed cohesion does NOT convert;
            // a cohesive team with no diversity has no Asia knowledge to deploy. This is the
            // boundary condition that punishes both the cohesion trap and diversity overload.

            // coreFactor: how much of the raw diversity actually CONVERTS to Asia capability.
            // "Add the right diversity, not the most" — replacing everyone (no continuity core)
            // or over-hiring strangers (3 external at once) inflates the index but leaves the
            // diversity un-anchored, so it does not become execution. This is what makes the
            // measured, core-protected slate strictly out-perform diversity-overload even after
            // a strong Round-3 integration recovery.
            let coreFactor = 1;
