                    insight_delivered:      `Horizon Asia delivered: you turned a homogeneous, Europe-only committee into a top team diverse enough to know Asia and cohesive enough to execute it — APAC revenue on a credible path to CHF 690M. You added the right diversity, not the most, and integrated it.`,
                    insight_fractured:      `Cohesion collapse: you added too much diversity too fast and never repaired the faultlines. A team of strangers from several cultures with no shared norms could not decide against a 12-month clock — perspective range you could not convert into execution.`,
                    insight_blind:          `Europe-blind execution: you protected cohesion by keeping the team homogeneous and forfeited the Asia market knowledge the strategy runs on. Entries led by people learning the region on the firm's time under-delivered — the cohesion trap.`,
                    insight_short:          `You fell short of the CHF 690M target. Re-examine where your team design broke down — most likely too little relevant diversity, an unintegrated team, or a sequence that outran your bandwidth.`,
                    insight_index_vanity:   `Your diversity index looks strong but cohesion collapsed beneath it — a board-presentation-ready number that the market never rewarded. TMT composition has to serve performance, not the index.`,
                    insight_cohesion_trap:  `Cohesion is high and diversity is low — the classic cohesion trap. A harmonious, fast-deciding team that has never operated in Asia cannot supply the market knowledge Horizon Asia depends on.`,
                    insight_overcap:        `You breached the 12-seat cap or the CHF 18M budget. TMT design is bounded by headcount and budget — every appointment displaces an alternative, and you cannot seat or fund people you do not have room for.`,
                    insight_converts:       `This is diversity that converts: nationality and experience range backed by a cohesive, integrated team. Six months past the first entries, the diverse top team is still deciding fast and winning Asia.`,

                    hint_fractured:         `Cohesion has fractured — you added diversity faster than the team could absorb. Pour budget into integration (onboarding, shared norms, faultline repair) before adding anyone else.`,
                    hint_blind:             `Diversity is dangerously low — you are entering Asia with a Europe-only team. Without real Asia operating experience on the committee, you have no local market knowledge to deploy.`,
                    hint_integrate:         `Cohesion is sagging under the new diversity. Invest in integration and protect decision speed, or the European core and the Asia hires will run parallel organisations.`,
                    hint_behind:            `APAC revenue is well behind the CHF 690M trajectory. Check that your sequence matches your bandwidth and that the right leaders are matched to the right markets.`,
                    hint_strong:            `Strong position — diversity, cohesion and entry readiness all healthy and APAC revenue on target. Lock in integration and profile-matched leadership so it lasts into the next phase.`,

